          "docs": "Accepts fccid as input and Returns contact details for Authorities Having Jurisdiction (AHJ) on-behalf-of local Public Safety Answering Points (PSAP). 911/PSAP accepts a location coordinate and returns PSAP contact data plus contact data for an AHJ to communicate directly with a PSAP. Details include agency name, phone number, city name, coverage, contact person's details, site details and mailing addresses for EMS, Fire, and Police PSAP contacts."
